<title>UK: Copel prices $150 million eight-year bond.</title>
<headline>Copel prices $150 million eight-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following has been priced, joint lead managers Santander Investment and Salomon Brothers said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CIA PARANAENSE DE ENERGIA (COPEL)</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	COUPON     9.75	MATURITY    ** MAY.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.618    PAY DATE    02.MAY.97</p>
<p> PAY FREQ   SEMI-ANN  REOFFER    99.618    SPREAD	+295</p>
<p> NOTES   ** PUT AND CALL IN 2002</p>
<p>		SPREAD OVER 02.MAY.02 PUT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
